"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "速度限制、每个种子的连接数、上传槽位和做种在添加种子时设置，或稍后在种子设置中修改。种子使用连接标签页中的代理（HTTP 或 SOCKS5，或通过“使用系统设置”使用 Mac 的代理）以及所有下载的速度限制。更改仅适用于之后开始的种子。节点和 Tracker 可以看到你的 IP 地址，或你的代理的地址。";
